  "description": "In this era of personal robots, robots do all the hard work for humans. One day, Alice, a high school girl, receives a mysterious parcel. All of a sudden, a robot pops out of the box! Alice finds out that her father has made and sent the robot. She is angry that her father didn’t come to see her. Furthermore, this robot is not like any other robot. \n\nIt’s impolite and stupid! She decides to give it a name anyway. What could be a good name for a stupid robot? \n\nShe came up with a perfect name. “Stoopy”! \n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53241582), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H036956053), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H036956053), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=4993836), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4116000535), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=1q26), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000052616)",
